<title>PHILIPPINES: Swift Foods H1 net loss 200.723 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Swift Foods H1 net loss 200.723 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swift Foods Inc, the meat processing arm of RFM Corp, reported on Monday a net loss of 200.723 million pesos for the first half ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>In the same period last year, the company had posted a net income of 126.029 million pesos.</p>
<p>Net sales in the first half of 1996/97 ending June were at 4.040 billion pesos compared to 3.659 billion pesos in the corresponding period in the previous year.</p>
</text>
